Offers"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "There are different ways to make and respond to offers.</br>You can make and respond to offers using modal verbs, like <span class=\"italic\">can</span> and <span class=\"italic\">would</span>.<br>Look at the chart:"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":3,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Making Offers\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Responding to Offers\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Can I help you?<br> Would you like \u2026 ? <br>Do you want ... or \u2026 ? <br>Here is \u2026 </span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Yes, I'd like \u2026  <br>Ok. <br>I want \u2026 <br>Thank you.<br><br>No, thank you. <br>Hm, I don't like \u2026</span> \\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Travel Agent</span>: Would you like to take this cruise?         <br>    <span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Hm, I don't like boats."}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Travel Agent</span>: Do you want economy or business class?      <br>       <span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Economy, please."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "travel agent "}, {"type": "definition", "content": " a person who helps to plan and organize trips and travel for people"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I am asking the travel agent about the price of my ticket."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le04ob06aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " These are words you use at the travel agency."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "travel agency"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a place to organize travel and buy tickets"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I am at the travel agency. I'm buying my ticket."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le04ob06aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "economy class"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the section of a plane where the tickets cost less money"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I prefer to sit in economy class."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le04ob06aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "business class"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the section of a plane where the tickets cost more"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The business class tickets are too expensive."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le04ob06aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "itinerary"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a document that lists the places you visit on a trip"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Here is a simple itinerary. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le04ob06aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "quote"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the price of a service or trip, before it is offered"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Here is a quote for the trip."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le04ob06aud06"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "cruise"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a journey on a boat to many places as a vacation"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I want to take a cruise around the islands."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le04ob06aud07"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "flight "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the event of flying"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Here is a quote for the trip, including flights and hotel."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le04ob06aud08"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "plane"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "airplane; a vehicle that flies in the sky"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I like to take planes."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le04ob06aud09"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Choose a country."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Create an itinerary."}, {"type": "text", "content": "List the activities you want to do."}, {"type": "text", "content": "List the places you want to go to."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Compare your itinerary with another person."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I create an itinerary."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I talk about travel."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I compare my itinerary with another person."}]}], "type": "sena"}